{"aliases":["@agent-ctrl/cli"],"authors":[],"details":{"availability":"Public Apache-2.0 Rust source, npm package and release binaries for Windows and macOS; Linux is built from source and is snapshot-read only. No model is bundled.","package_version":"0.1.4","release_tag":"v0.1.4","repository_revision":"7cc6b3d6d25ae6064aa1cf56d32df3af6e24a212"},"environments":["desktop","windows","macos","linux"],"evidence":[{"method":"editorial_primary_review","retrieved_at":"2026-10-20T08:22:41Z","role":"primary","sha256":"83ef4fe4a724261be2733d09636b44ffc50b882d89f3b3587a087a1b2867125e","supports":["name","kind","summary","environments","topics","scope","notes"],"url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/k4cper-g/agent-ctrl/HEAD/README.md"},{"method":"editorial_primary_review","retrieved_at":"2026-10-20T08:21:52Z","role":"primary","sha256":"83ef4fe4a724261be2733d09636b44ffc50b882d89f3b3587a087a1b2867125e","supports":["summary","environments","topics","notes","details.availability","details.repository_revision"],"url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/k4cper-g/agent-ctrl/7cc6b3d6d25ae6064aa1cf56d32df3af6e24a212/README.md"},{"method":"editorial_primary_review","retrieved_at":"2026-10-20T08:21:53Z","role":"primary","sha256":"f9b4b4ac293091890ee0f4918a96326b80f714023c294010e4300b5ef7466399","supports":["notes","details.package_version"],"url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/k4cper-g/agent-ctrl/7cc6b3d6d25ae6064aa1cf56d32df3af6e24a212/package.json"},{"method":"editorial_primary_review","retrieved_at":"2026-10-20T08:21:53Z","role":"primary","sha256":"6bcfe6ae39fb5c0ec1a7c4ca30cdf1cf4965f3c772947ed6c60f11ef60581f64","supports":["notes"],"url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/k4cper-g/agent-ctrl/7cc6b3d6d25ae6064aa1cf56d32df3af6e24a212/Cargo.toml"},{"method":"editorial_primary_review","retrieved_at":"2026-10-20T08:21:54Z","role":"primary","sha256":"b5b77cdbb6a4540d4f76354378b3a5506fc7408ce65de3c218df82ae15c8dbcb","supports":["summary","notes"],"url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/k4cper-g/agent-ctrl/7cc6b3d6d25ae6064aa1cf56d32df3af6e24a212/crates/surface-uia/src/windows_impl.rs"},{"method":"editorial_primary_review","retrieved_at":"2026-10-20T08:21:54Z","role":"primary","sha256":"da1e91a186b0a729b06b2e7a673a4ae84383a18a0fba32ea78827d5d31a09d49","supports":["summary","notes"],"url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/k4cper-g/agent-ctrl/7cc6b3d6d25ae6064aa1cf56d32df3af6e24a212/crates/surface-ax/src/macos.rs"},{"method":"editorial_primary_review","retrieved_at":"2026-10-20T08:21:54Z","role":"primary","sha256":"0f2b814fa5b2d95843af097896330f4ea524f8046ae637730b9f1583ccf9c465","supports":["environments","notes"],"url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/k4cper-g/agent-ctrl/7cc6b3d6d25ae6064aa1cf56d32df3af6e24a212/crates/surface-atspi/src/linux.rs"},{"method":"editorial_primary_review","retrieved_at":"2026-10-20T08:21:54Z","role":"primary","sha256":"71696a8c0214c93f3c693cfcae345f026287e46611e7d5e8d0659ab364c0f936","supports":["licenses.code"],"url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/k4cper-g/agent-ctrl/7cc6b3d6d25ae6064aa1cf56d32df3af6e24a212/LICENSE"},{"method":"editorial_primary_review","retrieved_at":"2026-10-20T08:22:19Z","role":"primary","sha256":"cd7cf488acfd83e5b78bf4040e350eca3f2f0586b096d6d49b45ddc3a9c749e0","supports":["details.release_tag","details.repository_revision"],"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/k4cper-g/agent-ctrl/git/tags/37ad90bd95020d9c421d214cf9623f700cd64e44"},{"method":"license_header","retrieved_at":"2026-10-20T08:22:50Z","role":"primary","sha256":"71696a8c0214c93f3c693cfcae345f026287e46611e7d5e8d0659ab364c0f936","supports":["licenses.code"],"url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/k4cper-g/agent-ctrl/HEAD/LICENSE"}],"id":"github:k4cper-g/agent-ctrl","identifiers":{},"kind":"tool","last_verified_at":"2026-10-20T08:22:41Z","licenses":{"code":{"basis":"repository LICENSE header; not a weights/data license","declared":"Apache-2.0","retrieved_at":"2026-10-20T08:22:50Z","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/k4cper-g/agent-ctrl/HEAD/LICENSE"},"data":null,"document":null,"weights":null},"links":[{"rel":"primary","url":"https://github.com/k4cper-g/agent-ctrl"}],"name":"agent-ctrl","notes":"Published on npm as @agent-ctrl/cli (package.json and Cargo.toml 0.1.4; annotated tag v0.1.4 points at the inspected commit), with release binaries for Windows x64 and macOS arm64/x64 and a typed @agent-ctrl/client TypeScript wrapper. agent-ctrl open <surface> starts a per-session daemon; snapshot pins a target window and returns its accessibility tree with @eN action refs and @sN scope refs, which click, type, fill, select, check, scroll, drag, press, wait and find commands consume. Screenshots of a window, region, element or the desktop can be annotated with cached refs. Windows (crates/surface-uia, UI Automation patterns plus SendInput) and macOS (crates/surface-ax, Accessibility plus CGEvent input) have the full action vocabulary; Linux (crates/surface-atspi) only snapshots, finds, inspects and lists windows, and Android and iOS surfaces are planned. The README leaves browser automation to the separate agent-browser project. The tool contains no model or agent loop. Code was read, not run.","published_at":null,"relations":[],"review_status":"curated","scope":"core","summary":"Rust CLI and daemon that let agents snapshot native app accessibility trees as element refs and act on them, with UI Automation on Windows, AX on macOS and a read-only AT-SPI surface on Linux.","topics":["tool-integration","automation","screen-understanding"],"updated_at":null,"url":"https://github.com/k4cper-g/agent-ctrl"}
